{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "MakeAIVideo API",
    "version": "1.2",
    "description": "Public v1 API for MakeAIVideo: turn a brief or your own script into a finished short-form video (script, voiceover, AI or stock scenes, captions, music), edit and regenerate parts of it, and fetch the MP4. Everything the product can do, agents can do.\n\n## Authentication\nAll endpoints except the device-login pair accept an API key:\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer mav_...\n```\nCreate keys under Settings, Advanced, API keys, or with `makeaivideo login` (CLI device flow). Keys carry scopes (`read`, `write`, `ai`); each operation lists its scope under `x-scope`. `read` lists and inspects; `write` creates, edits, regenerates, deletes (and spends credits); `ai` covers generation helpers (scripts, ideas, portraits, previews, music). A missing scope returns `403 forbidden`.\n\n## Envelope\nEvery JSON response is `{ data, error, meta }`. On failure `data` is null and `error` is `{ message, code, retryable, details? }`. `retryable` is true only for 5xx and 429; never retry a 4xx without changing the request. Two endpoints return files instead of JSON: `GET /videos/{id}/captions`.\n\n## The core loop\n1. `GET /tools` (what we can make). 2. `POST /videos/estimate` (free quote). 3. `POST /videos` with `tool` + `fields`, or with your own `script` (202, `video_id`). 4. Poll `GET /videos/{id}` respecting `poll_after_seconds`, or subscribe to `video.ready` with `POST /webhooks`. 5. `GET /videos/{id}/download`.\n\nRenders take minutes. Set `idempotency_key` on create so a retry never produces (and charges for) a second video.\n\n## Publishing to social accounts\nPost finished videos to the workspace's connected accounts: TikTok, Instagram (as a Reel), YouTube (9:16 as a Short, 16:9 as a regular video), Facebook Pages, LinkedIn, X (videos up to 140 seconds), Threads, Pinterest, Bluesky, Telegram and Discord.\n1. `GET /publishing/accounts` lists connected accounts (`acc_...` ids, `can_post`, `needs_reconnection`), the plan's account limit and every platform. 2. To add an OAuth account, `POST /publishing/accounts/connect` returns a short-lived `url` that a PERSON must open in a browser and approve; an agent cannot complete it. Bluesky, Telegram and Discord connect with credentials in the web app only (the Accounts page). 3. `POST /videos/{id}/publish` with `account_ids` and `caption` answers 202 with a post (`pub_...`); set `idempotency_key` so a retry never posts twice. 4. Poll `GET /publishing/posts/{id}` until `done` is true, or subscribe to `post.published`, `post.partially_failed` and `post.failed`. Each destination carries its own `status`, live `url` and `error`.\nA workspace where publishing is not switched on gets `403 publishing_unavailable` (not retryable).\n\n## Webhooks\n`POST /webhooks` with a public https URL and events. Every delivery is signed: `X-MakeAIVideo-Signature: sha256=<HMAC-SHA256(raw body, secret)>`, with `X-MakeAIVideo-Event`, `X-MakeAIVideo-Event-Id` (dedup key), `X-MakeAIVideo-Timestamp` and `X-MakeAIVideo-Attempt`. Non-2xx responses retry at 30s, 2m, 10m, 1h, 6h, then stop. Twenty consecutive failures disable the webhook until you PATCH `is_active: true`.\nEvents: `video.created`, `video.ready`, `video.failed`, `character.created`, and for publishing `post.published` (every destination went out), `post.partially_failed` and `post.failed`. A `post.*` event's `data` is the same Post object `GET /publishing/posts/{id}` returns. A post can emit a second outcome if a failed destination is retried later."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://app.makeaivideo.ai/api/v1",
      "description": "Production"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "apiKey": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Introspection"
    },
    {
      "name": "Videos",
      "description": "Create, inspect, edit, regenerate, export and download videos."
    },
    {
      "name": "Scripts",
      "description": "Write or structure a script before rendering."
    },
    {
      "name": "Characters"
    },
    {
      "name": "Voices"
    },
    {
      "name": "Music"
    },
    {
      "name": "Uploads"
    },
    {
      "name": "Brand kit"
    },
    {
      "name": "Workspace"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ideas"
    },
    {
      "name": "Publishing",
      "description": "Connect social accounts and post finished videos to them."
    },
    {
      "name": "Webhooks"
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "CLI device-code login (RFC 8628). Unauthenticated."
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/me": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Introspection"
        ],
        "summary": "Who am I",
        "operationId": "getMe",
        "x-scope": "read",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Key, user, organization and credits",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Me"
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": "null"
                    },
                    "meta": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meta"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Missing or invalid key",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/credits": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Introspection"
        ],
        "summary": "Credit balance",
        "operationId": "getCredits",
        "x-scope": "read",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Balance",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Credits"
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": "null"
                    },
                    "meta": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meta"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/tools": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Introspection"
        ],
        "summary": "List create tools and their brief fields",
        "operationId": "listTools",
        "x-scope": "read",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Tools",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Tools"
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": "null"
                    },
                    "meta": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meta"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/workspace": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Workspace"
        ],
        "summary": "The workspace this key works in",
        "operationId": "getWorkspace",
        "x-scope": "read",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Workspace",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "workspace": {
                          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Workspace"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": "null"
                    },
                    "meta": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meta"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "patch": {
        "tags": [
          "Workspace"
        ],
        "summary": "Update workspace defaults",
        "operationId": "updateWorkspace",
        "x-scope": "write",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "name": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "description": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "default_aspect_ratio": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "9:16",
                      "1:1",
                      "16:9"
                    ]
                  },
                  "default_style": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "talking-head",
                      "cinematic"
                    ]
                  },
                  "default_character_id": {
                    "type": [
                      "integer",
                      "null"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Workspace",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "workspace": {
                          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Workspace"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": "null"
                    },
                    "meta": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meta"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Owners and admins only",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/videos": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Videos"
        ],
        "summary": "List videos",
        "operationId": "listVideos",
        "x-scope": "read",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Videos",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/VideoList"
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": "null"
                    },
                    "meta": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meta"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Videos"
        ],
        "summary": "Create a video from a brief or your own script",
        "operationId": "createVideo",
        "x-scope": "write",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateVideo"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "description": "Accepted. status is `generating`, or `draft` when start_generation is false",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/VideoCreated"
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": "null"
                    },
                    "meta": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meta"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid brief or script",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "Not enough credits or no active subscription",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Key lacks the write scope",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Rate or spend limit reached; see Retry-After",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/videos/estimate": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Videos"
        ],
        "summary": "Free credit quote",
        "operationId": "estimateVideo",
        "x-scope": "read",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "tool": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "duration_seconds": {
                    "type": "integer"
                  },
                  "aspect_ratio": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "9:16",
                      "1:1",
                      "16:9"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "tool"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Quote",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "tool": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "duration_seconds": {
                          "type": "integer"
                        },
                        "aspect_ratio": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "credits": {
                          "type": "integer"
                        },
                        "note": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": "null"
                    },
                    "meta": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meta"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/videos/{id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Videos"
        ],
        "summary": "Video status and progress",
        "operationId": "getVideo",
        "x-scope": "read",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "Public video id, e.g. vid_abc123"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Status",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Video"
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": "null"
                    },
                    "meta": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meta"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Unknown video",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "patch": {
        "tags": [
          "Videos"
        ],
        "summary": "Edit title, topic, script or caption settings",
        "operationId": "updateVideo",
        "x-scope": "write",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "Public video id, e.g. vid_abc123"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "title": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "topic": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "script": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "title": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "hook": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "visual_thread": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "total_duration_seconds": {
                        "type": "number"
                      },
                      "hashtags": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "scenes": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "scene_number": {
                              "type": "integer"
                            },
                            "narration": {
                              "type": "string"
                            },
                            "visual_description": {
                              "type": "string"
                            },
                            "duration_seconds": {
                              "type": "number"
                            },
                            "scene_type": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "enum": [
                                "character",
                                "scene"
                              ]
                            },
                            "image_prompt": {
                              "type": "string"
                            },
                            "video_prompt": {
                              "type": "string"
                            }
                          },
                          "required": [
                            "scene_number",
                            "narration",
                            "visual_description",
                            "duration_seconds"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "title",
                      "hook",
                      "scenes",
                      "total_duration_seconds"
                    ]
                  },
                  "caption_style": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "caption_alignment": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "top",
                      "middle",
                      "bottom"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Saved. Script changes apply on the next generate",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "video_id": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "saved_at": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": "null"
                    },
                    "meta": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meta"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Unknown video",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "delete": {
        "tags": [
          "Videos"
        ],
        "summary": "Delete a video and its files",
        "operationId": "deleteVideo",
        "x-scope": "write",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "Public video id, e.g. vid_abc123"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Deleted",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "video_id": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "deleted": {
                          "type": "boolean"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": "null"
                    },
                    "meta": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meta"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Unknown video",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/videos/{id}/generate": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Videos"
        ],
        "summary": "Start or re-run generation (drafts, or after edits)",
        "operationId": "generateVideo",
        "x-scope": "write",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "Public video id, e.g. vid_abc123"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "description": "Accepted",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "video_id": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "status": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "poll_after_seconds": {
                          "type": [
                            "integer",
                            "null"
                          ]
                        },
                        "credits_estimate": {
                          "type": [
                            "integer",
                            "null"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": "null"
                    },
                    "meta": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meta"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Already generating",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/videos/{id}/cancel": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Videos"
        ],
        "summary": "Cancel a running render and release its credits",
        "operationId": "cancelVideo",
        "x-scope": "write",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "Public video id, e.g. vid_abc123"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Cancelled",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "video_id": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "status": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "failed"
                          ]
                        },
                        "cancelled": {
                          "type": "boolean"
                        },
                        "released_credits": {
                          "type": "integer"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": "null"
                    },
                    "meta": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meta"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Not running",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/videos/{id}/download": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Videos"
        ],
        "summary": "Signed download URL for the finished MP4",
        "operationId": "downloadVideo",
        "x-scope": "read",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "Public video id, e.g. vid_abc123"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "URL valid 15 minutes",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "video_id": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "download_url": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "format": "uri"
                        },
                        "expires_in": {
                          "type": "integer"
                        },
                        "note": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": "null"
                    },
                    "meta": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meta"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Unknown video",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Not ready yet (retryable)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/videos/{id}/renders": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Videos"
        ],
